<title>SINGAPORE: Fuji Offset half-year net up 93 percent.</title>
<headline>Fuji Offset half-year net up 93 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.72  vs   0.89</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    3.40  vs   1.80</p>
<p>    Turnover				10.35  vs  12.75</p>
<p>    Interest income			0.02  vs    -</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     0.09  vs   0.29</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   1.00  vs   1.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 2.17  vs   1.42</p>
<p>    Tax					0.48  vs   0.52</p>
<p>Note - Fuji Offset Plates Manufacturing Ltd makes aluminium offset plates and related industrial chemicals for the printing industry.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
